{
  "ep": "EP08",
  "title": "生日派对上的滑滑梯",
  "default_gap": 0.3,
  "gaps": {"B01": 0.6, "B04": 0.5, "B05en": 0.5, "B06en": 0.5, "B09": 0.5, "B10en": 0.5, "B11en": 0.5, "B14en": 0.5, "B15": 0.5, "B35": 0.5, "B36": 0.5, "B40": 0.5},
  "segments": [
    {"id": "B01", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.9, "text": "哒哒哒——！声音探险队，出发！"},
    {"id": "B02", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "小Q，生日快乐！今天我们来到一场生日派对，元音城堡第七站。上一站抓到的卷舌弹簧和偷懒叹气，地图上又亮了两格。"},
    {"id": "X01", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "是我的生日吗？有礼物吗？"},
    {"id": "B03", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "是派对小寿星的生日。今天要抓的这两个精灵啊，不爱站着不动，它们最爱滑滑梯。"},
    {"id": "X02", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "滑滑梯？我也爱！"},
    {"id": "B04", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "欢迎来到生日派对现场！桌上摆着蛋糕，墙上挂着风筝，窗外还下起了小雨。"},
    {"id": "B05", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "先看桌上那个蛋糕。小寿星要许愿了，大家一起喊——"},
    {"id": "B05en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "ay"},
    {"id": "X03", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "诶——衣！像在叫谁的名字！"},
    {"id": "B06", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "眼睛真尖。这个音的起点是「诶」，嘴巴扁扁的；然后往上、往前滑，滑到「衣」，下巴一点点合上。一个音，走出两段路——"},
    {"id": "B06en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "ay"},
    {"id": "X04", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "诶衣！诶衣！真的像滑滑梯！"},
    {"id": "B07", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "没错！它就是滑滑梯哥哥。而且它是字母 A 自己的名字——你念字母表的时候，天天都在念它。听——"},
    {"id": "B07en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "A"},
    {"id": "B08", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "对，就是这一声。它就住在 cake 里。跟我读——"},
    {"id": "B08en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "cake."},
    {"id": "X05", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "cake！蛋糕！"},
    {"id": "B09", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "记住口诀：从诶滑到衣，滑梯一溜到底，这是字母 A 的名字。"},
    {"id": "B10", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "再看墙上那只风筝。风一吹，它突然掉了下来，你抬头一看，吓一跳——"},
    {"id": "B10en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "I"},
    {"id": "X06", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "啊——衣！我的心脏！"},
    {"id": "B11", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "就是这个！这个音的起点低多了：嘴巴张得大大的，从「啊」起步，然后猛地往上滑到「衣」，下巴抬起来——"},
    {"id": "B11en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "I"},
    {"id": "X07", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "啊衣！比刚才那个张得大多了！"},
    {"id": "B12", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "对！哥哥从扁扁的「诶」起步，弟弟从大大的「啊」起步。弟弟是字母 I 自己的名字，它就住在 bike 里。跟我读——"},
    {"id": "B12en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "bike."},
    {"id": "X08", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "bike！自行车！"},
    {"id": "B13", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "记住口诀：看到风筝吓一跳，啊——衣，这是字母 I 的名字。"},
    {"id": "B14", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "两个精灵都是滑滑梯，都是一个音里装了两条路，区别只在一个地方——起点。来，对比读三遍——"},
    {"id": "B14en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.75, "text": "cake. bike. cake. bike. cake. bike."},
    {"id": "X09", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.95, "text": "cake. bike. cake. bike. cake. bike."},
    {"id": "B15", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "漂亮！进入单词宝藏时间！每个单词两遍——先慢速，再常速。仔细听！"},
    {"id": "B16", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "cake."},
    {"id": "B17", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "蛋糕。滑滑梯哥哥家的第一个小朋友，从诶滑到衣。"},
    {"id": "X10", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "cake！蛋糕！"},
    {"id": "B18", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "cake."},
    {"id": "B19", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "name."},
    {"id": "B20", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "名字。生日帽上写的那个名字。"},
    {"id": "X11", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "name！名字！"},
    {"id": "B21", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "name."},
    {"id": "B22", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "rain."},
    {"id": "B23", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "下雨。窗外下着雨，所以派对在屋里开。"},
    {"id": "X12", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "rain！下雨！"},
    {"id": "B24", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "rain."},
    {"id": "B25", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "bike."},
    {"id": "B26", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "自行车。小寿星的生日礼物就是它——啊——衣。"},
    {"id": "X13", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "bike！自行车！"},
    {"id": "B27", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "bike."},
    {"id": "B28", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "kite."},
    {"id": "B29", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "风筝。挂在墙上、刚才差点掉下来的那只。"},
    {"id": "X14", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "kite！风筝！"},
    {"id": "B30", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "kite."},
    {"id": "B31", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "five."},
    {"id": "B32", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "五。蛋糕上插着五根蜡烛。"},
    {"id": "X15", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "five！五根蜡烛！"},
    {"id": "B33", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "five."},
    {"id": "B34", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "六个单词全部到手！进入口诀记忆屋，拍手跟我念——"},
    {"id": "B35", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.8, "text": "滑滑梯，溜两段，诶滑到衣，是字母 A，蛋糕 cake、名字 name、窗外 rain；啊滑到衣，是字母 I，自行车 bike、风筝 kite、蜡烛 five。起点不同路线变，一高一低记心间！"},
    {"id": "X16", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.9, "text": "滑滑梯，溜两段，诶滑到衣，是字母 A，蛋糕 cake、名字 name、窗外 rain；啊滑到衣，是字母 I，自行车 bike、风筝 kite、蜡烛 five。起点不同路线变，一高一低记心间！"},
    {"id": "B36", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "满血毕业！听辨大挑战来了！我念两个词，你说哪个是哥哥、哪个是弟弟。第一题——"},
    {"id": "B36en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.7, "text": "cake. kite."},
    {"id": "X17", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "第一个 cake 是蛋糕，哥哥！第二个 kite 是风筝，弟弟！"},
    {"id": "B37", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "全对！奖励一颗星！第二题——"},
    {"id": "B37en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.7, "text": "lake. like."},
    {"id": "X18", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "嗯……两个都是 lake！都是湖！这儿居然有两个湖！"},
    {"id": "B38", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "揭晓——第一个是 lake，湖，哥哥；第二个是 like，喜欢，弟弟。连起来就是：我喜欢这个湖。"},
    {"id": "X19", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "啊？我还以为你带我去看两个湖呢！"},
    {"id": "B39", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "错一题才记得牢。第三题，最后一题——"},
    {"id": "B39en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.7, "text": "name. nine."},
    {"id": "X20", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "name 是名字，哥哥！nine 是九，弟弟！"},
    {"id": "B40", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "完全正确！今天两颗半星，收好。"},
    {"id": "B41", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "今天的探险就到这里。下一站，我们打开玩具箱，还得小心感冒。"},
    {"id": "X21", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "感冒？要打喷嚏吗？"},
    {"id": "B42", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.9, "text": "要打喷嚏。还有一个看到玩具就欢呼的精灵，一个嘴里含着糖说话的精灵。声音探险队，下一站见！"},
    {"id": "X22", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "下一站见！我要吹蜡烛！"}
  ]
}
